00:01:08.559 --> 00:01:09.892
THE HOMELESS CRISIS IS NOT

00:01:09.893 --> 00:01:11.160
LIMITED TO BIG POPULATION

00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:11.527
CENTERS.

00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:13.462
SOME OF THE HARDEST HIT

00:01:13.463 --> 00:01:15.832
PLACES ARE SMALL CITIES AND

00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:17.200
TOWNS WHERE EVEN A SMALL

00:01:17.201 --> 00:01:18.634
HOMELESS POPULATION CAN PUT

00:01:18.635 --> 00:01:20.002
MASSIVE STRAIN ON PUBLIC

00:01:20.003 --> 00:01:20.336
SERVICE.

00:01:20.337 --> 00:01:22.071
FOR THE LATEST INSTALLMENT

00:01:22.072 --> 00:01:24.173
IN OUR SERIES HOMELESS IN

00:01:24.174 --> 00:01:24.507
AMERICA.

00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:25.541
OUR PRODUCER WENT TO OREGON

00:01:25.542 --> 00:01:27.410
WHERE ONE SMALL CHARITY IS

00:01:27.411 --> 00:01:28.411
FIGHTING TO IMPROVE A

00:01:28.412 --> 00:01:29.378
DESPERATE SITUATION IN

00:01:29.379 --> 00:01:29.712
EUGENE.

00:01:29.713 --> 00:01:32.381
WATCH.

00:01:32.382 --> 00:01:35.117
OUR FIRST STOP IN PORTLAND,

00:01:35.118 --> 00:01:36.619
OBAMACARE WASN'T MEANT TO BE

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.955
WORK RELATED FOR BREAKFAST

00:01:38.956 --> 00:01:40.223
IN UPSCALE FASHIONABLE PEARL

00:01:40.224 --> 00:01:40.590
DISTRICT.

00:01:40.591 --> 00:01:42.425
WHEN WE ARRIVED WE FOUND A

00:01:42.426 --> 00:01:43.259
HOMELESS MAN RIFLING THROUGH

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:44.894
A CRASH CAN IN THE PARKING

00:01:44.895 --> 00:01:47.163
LOT A DIRTY SYRINGE.

00:01:47.164 --> 00:01:48.030
HOMELESSNESS IN PORTLAND

00:01:48.031 --> 00:01:49.131
LOOKS A LOT LIKE WHAT WE

00:01:49.132 --> 00:01:50.499
HAVE SEEN IN OTHER CITIES.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.834
LOTS OF TENTS, LOTS OF

00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:53.002
DRUGS.

00:01:53.003 --> 00:01:54.637
THE CITY'S PERMISSIVE

00:01:54.638 --> 00:01:55.571
CULTURE TEMPERATE CLIMATE

00:01:55.572 --> 00:01:57.673
AND GENEROUS SOCIAL SERVICES

00:01:57.674 --> 00:01:59.075
ATTRACT I HAVE A GRANTS AND

00:01:59.076 --> 00:02:00.309
ADDICTS FROM AROUND THE

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:00.643
COUNTRY.

00:02:00.644 --> 00:02:02.912
WE MET A WOMAN CALLED

00:02:02.913 --> 00:02:04.680
LIBERTY HOPE OFF CLOVERLEAF

00:02:04.681 --> 00:02:05.715
SHE SAYS SHE CAME TO THE

00:02:05.716 --> 00:02:07.083
WEST COAST BECAUSE SHE

00:02:07.084 --> 00:02:08.751
NEEDED MEDICAL TREATMENT FOR

00:02:08.752 --> 00:02:09.452
HER LEUKEMIA.

00:02:09.453 --> 00:02:11.854
SHE MOVED TO PORTLAND AFTER

00:02:11.855 --> 00:02:14.257
POLICE TOWED HER MOTOR HOME.

00:02:14.258 --> 00:02:16.125
&gt;&gt; THEY TOWED MY MOTOR HOME.

00:02:16.126 --> 00:02:17.493
GOT OUT NOWHERE TO GO.

00:02:17.494 --> 00:02:18.728
BUT I COULDN'T LEAVE BECAUSE

00:02:18.729 --> 00:02:19.795
I STILL HAD TREATMENTS I HAD

00:02:19.796 --> 00:02:21.197
TO DO.

00:02:21.198 --> 00:02:21.864
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOPE SAYS SHE IS

00:02:21.865 --> 00:02:23.332
BLESSED BECAUSE THE CITY

00:02:23.333 --> 00:02:24.734
SHUTTLES HER BETWEEN MEDICAL

00:02:24.735 --> 00:02:25.635
CLINIC AND HER TENT.

00:02:25.636 --> 00:02:26.969
SHE HOPES TO GET BACK TO

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:28.337
HOME STATE OF MONTANA ONCE

00:02:28.338 --> 00:02:29.305
SHE IS HEALTHY AGAIN.

00:02:29.306 --> 00:02:30.106
&gt;&gt; HOW LONG DO YOU THINK YOU

00:02:30.107 --> 00:02:30.573
WILL BE HERE.

00:02:30.574 --> 00:02:32.074
&gt;&gt; I'M NOT TOO SURE.

00:02:32.075 --> 00:02:33.376
I BROKE MY FOOT THIS PAST

00:02:33.377 --> 00:02:35.378
WINTER SO IT KIND OF SET ME

00:02:35.379 --> 00:02:35.678
BACK.

00:02:35.679 --> 00:02:37.546
WITH MY MEDICAL.

00:02:37.547 --> 00:02:38.814
BUT I'M A MIRACLE SO EVERY

00:02:38.815 --> 00:02:41.484
DAY IS A MIRACLE.

00:02:41.485 --> 00:02:43.352
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SIMILAR TENT

00:02:43.353 --> 00:02:45.321
ENCAMPMENTS LINE PORTLAND'S

00:02:45.322 --> 00:02:46.989
IOWAS EVERY OPEN FACE IN THE

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:48.090
CITY SEEMS PACKED WITH

00:02:48.091 --> 00:02:49.158
PEOPLE LIVING OUTSIDE AND

00:02:49.159 --> 00:02:50.993
USING DRUGS.

00:02:50.994 --> 00:02:52.929
RIVER FRONT PARK DOWNTOWN

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:55.298
RECEPTACLE FOR USED HEROIN

00:02:55.299 --> 00:02:55.665
SYRINGES.

00:02:55.666 --> 00:02:58.367
OREGON IS A SMALL STATE BUT

00:02:58.368 --> 00:02:59.735
HOMELESS PEOPLE MORE PER

00:02:59.736 --> 00:03:00.536
CAPITA THAN NEIGHBORING

00:03:00.537 --> 00:03:01.203
WASHINGTON OR CALIFORNIA.

00:03:01.204 --> 00:03:02.238
TO GET A SENSE OF THE SCALE

00:03:02.239 --> 00:03:04.106
OF THE PROBLEM, WE DROVE TO

00:03:04.107 --> 00:03:04.774
EUGENE IN THE CENTRAL PART

00:03:04.775 --> 00:03:05.908
OF THE STATE.

00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:08.511
EUGENE IS A COLLEGE WITH A

00:03:08.512 --> 00:03:09.412
POLITICS TO MATCH.

00:03:09.413 --> 00:03:11.547
NOT SURPRISINGLY IT HAS

00:03:11.548 --> 00:03:12.648
ENORMOUS HOMELESS

00:03:12.649 --> 00:03:13.215
POPULATION.

00:03:13.216 --> 00:03:14.650
ULTIMATELY, HOWEVER, EVEN

00:03:14.651 --> 00:03:17.553
THE GENEROSITY OF A PLACE

00:03:17.554 --> 00:03:18.387
LIKE EUGENE HAS LIMITS.

00:03:18.388 --> 00:03:20.089
ON THE NIGHT WE ARRIVED

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.557
MULTIPLE PEOPLE LIVING IN

00:03:21.558 --> 00:03:22.858
THIS MAKESHIFT STRUCTURE.

00:03:22.859 --> 00:03:23.993
TWO DAYS LATER THE CITY HAD

00:03:23.994 --> 00:03:25.094
CLEARED THE SIDEWALK AND PUT

00:03:25.095 --> 00:03:26.429
UP NOTICES IT WAS GOING TO

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.364
SCRAP THE BELONGINGS INSIDE.

00:03:28.365 --> 00:03:29.732
EUGENE IS TRYING TO GET A

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:30.666
HANDLE ON HOMELESS PROBLEM

00:03:30.667 --> 00:03:32.201
BUT THERE ARE ROAD BLOCKS.

00:03:32.202 --> 00:03:34.437
A MAJOR ONE, A RULING BY THE

00:03:34.438 --> 00:03:35.638
FEDERAL NINTH CIRCUIT OF

00:03:35.639 --> 00:03:36.872
APPEALS THAT HAS DECLARED

00:03:36.873 --> 00:03:38.307
IT'S SOMEHOW

00:03:38.308 --> 00:03:39.442
UNCONSTITUTIONAL TO SHOE

00:03:39.443 --> 00:03:40.443
AWAY HOMELESS PEOPLE IF

00:03:40.444 --> 00:03:41.477
THERE IS NO PLACE FOR THEM

00:03:41.478 --> 00:03:42.712
TO GO.

00:03:42.713 --> 00:03:43.546
EUGENE'S LEADERS HAVE

00:03:43.547 --> 00:03:46.015
RESPONDED BY TRYING TO ERECT

00:03:46.016 --> 00:03:47.917
TENT CITIES ON PUBLIC LAND.

00:03:47.918 --> 00:03:49.652
ONE PROPOSAL ENVISIONED

00:03:49.653 --> 00:03:51.020
HOMELESS ENCAMPMENT PARKING

00:03:51.021 --> 00:03:51.887
LOT AT THE CENTER OF

00:03:51.888 --> 00:03:52.254
DOWNTOWN.

00:03:52.255 --> 00:03:53.789
SO FAR THOSE EFFORTS HAVE

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:54.357
FAILED.

00:03:54.358 --> 00:03:57.093
A LOCAL CHARITY CALLED SAINT

00:03:57.094 --> 00:03:58.527
VINCENT DEPAUL HAS STEPPED

00:03:58.528 --> 00:03:59.662
IN WITH OWN SOLUTION.

00:03:59.663 --> 00:04:01.297
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A MASH TENT.

00:04:01.298 --> 00:04:03.065
A STRUCTURE THAT WAS USED BY

00:04:03.066 --> 00:04:04.533
THE MILITARY IN SOME OF OUR

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:06.202
FOREIGN DEPLOYMENTS.

00:04:06.203 --> 00:04:07.069
&gt;&gt; Tucker: OTHER CITIES ON

00:04:07.070 --> 00:04:08.704
THE WEST CODE HAVE TRIED TO

00:04:08.705 --> 00:04:09.572
PROVIDE HOUSING FOR THE

00:04:09.573 --> 00:04:10.639
HOMELESS.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:11.574
USUALLY AT REMARKABLE

00:04:11.575 --> 00:04:12.008
COMPENSATION.

00:04:12.009 --> 00:04:13.242
SAN JOSE, CALIFORNIA, FOR

00:04:13.243 --> 00:04:14.844
EXAMPLE, IS SPENDING

00:04:14.845 --> 00:04:15.478
$37 MILLION ON A BUILDING

00:04:15.479 --> 00:04:17.113
THAT WILL HOUSE JUST 83

00:04:17.114 --> 00:04:18.114
PEOPLE.

00:04:18.115 --> 00:04:20.983
BY CONTRAST, SAINT VINCENT

00:04:20.984 --> 00:04:22.151
DEPAUL'S ANSWER IS SIMPLE

00:04:22.152 --> 00:04:22.618
AND CHEAP.

00:04:22.619 --> 00:04:25.087
&gt;&gt; WE PUT THIS WHOLE SECTION

00:04:25.088 --> 00:04:26.255
OF TENTS UP WITH A WORK CREW

00:04:26.256 --> 00:04:27.990
IN ONE DAY.

00:04:27.991 --> 00:04:28.591
&gt;&gt; Tucker: RESIDENTS ARE

00:04:28.592 --> 00:04:29.558
ASSIGNED A BED AND GIVEN A

00:04:29.559 --> 00:04:31.093
PLACE TO STORE THEIR

00:04:31.094 --> 00:04:31.494
BELONGINGS.

00:04:31.495 --> 00:04:32.161
THEY ARE EXPECTED TO MAKE

00:04:32.162 --> 00:04:33.362
THEIR BEDS EVERY DAY TO

00:04:33.363 --> 00:04:34.964
INSTILL A SENSE OF PRIDE AND

00:04:34.965 --> 00:04:35.364
SELF-WORTH.

00:04:35.365 --> 00:04:36.699
THE SHELTER IS OPEN TO

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.800
ANYONE, INCLUDING DRUNKS AND

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:39.468
DRUG USERS.

00:04:39.469 --> 00:04:40.836
THOSE WHO STAY GET TREATED

00:04:40.837 --> 00:04:41.604
FOR ADDICTION.

00:04:41.605 --> 00:04:42.471
THE STRATEGY ESSENTIALLY IS

00:04:42.472 --> 00:04:43.939
THE OPPOSITE OF WHAT CITIES

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:44.707
LIKE SEATTLE AND SAN

00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:46.609
FRANCISCO ARE DOING.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:47.977
SAINT VINCENT DEPAUL'S GOAL

00:04:47.978 --> 00:04:49.145
IS TO GET PEOPLE OFF THE

00:04:49.146 --> 00:04:50.479
STREETS AND INTO AN

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:51.614
ENVIRONMENT WHERE THEY MIGHT

00:04:51.615 --> 00:04:52.314
ACTUALLY RECOVER.

00:04:52.315 --> 00:04:53.616
OF THE HOUSING ISN'T MEANT

00:04:53.617 --> 00:04:54.917
TO BE PERMANENT.

00:04:54.918 --> 00:04:56.619
SAINT VINCENT DEPAUL TRIES

00:04:56.620 --> 00:04:57.887
TO GET RESIDENTS CLEANED UP

00:04:57.888 --> 00:04:58.721
AND READY FOR LONG-TERM

00:04:58.722 --> 00:05:00.089
HOUSING IN JUST A FEW

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:00.456
MONTHS.

00:05:00.457 --> 00:05:01.257
FOR MANY THE STRATEGY

00:05:01.258 --> 00:05:02.458
APPEARS TO BE WORKING.

00:05:02.459 --> 00:05:04.026
&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE THE ODDS THAT IN

00:05:04.027 --> 00:05:05.127
TWO YEARS THEY ARE BACK ON

00:05:05.128 --> 00:05:05.561
THE STREETS?

00:05:05.562 --> 00:05:07.897
&gt;&gt; IF THEY STAY IN PROGRAMS

00:05:07.898 --> 00:05:08.864
AND IN ASSOCIATION WITH

00:05:08.865 --> 00:05:11.534
PEOPLE THAT ARE CLEAN AND

00:05:11.535 --> 00:05:12.468
SOBER, CHANCES ARE PRETTY

00:05:12.469 --> 00:05:13.436
GOOD THAT THEY ARE GOING TO

00:05:13.437 --> 00:05:16.505
STAY OUT.

00:05:16.506 --> 00:05:17.239
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELL THE HOMELESS

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:18.707
CRISIS APPEARS TO BE GETTING

00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:19.809
WORSE PRETTY MUCH EVERYWHERE

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:20.943
IN AMERICA RATHER THAN TRY

00:05:20.944 --> 00:05:22.511
TO FIX THE PROBLEM THOUGH

00:05:22.512 --> 00:05:23.746
ELITES PREFER TO ATTACK ITS

00:05:23.747 --> 00:05:24.080
VICTIMS.

00:05:24.081 --> 00:05:25.114
IN THE CITY OF SEATTLE, ONE

00:05:25.115 --> 00:05:26.982
OF THE PLACES HIT HARDEST BY

00:05:26.983 --> 00:05:28.751
THIS CRISIS, A WOMAN HAS

00:05:28.752 --> 00:05:30.086
FACED, BELIEVE IT OR NOT,

00:05:30.087 --> 00:05:31.554
BACKLASH FOR SEEKING JUSTICE

00:05:31.555 --> 00:05:32.655
AFTER SHE SAYS SHE WAS RAPED

00:05:32.656 --> 00:05:35.558
BY A HOMELESS MAN WITH

00:05:35.559 --> 00:05:36.559
MULTIPLE ARREST WARRANTS.

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.327
WE WILL INTERVIEW A

00:05:38.328 --> 00:05:39.863
DOCUMENTARY FILMMAKER WHO

